From d948623d02a95814c7fee2852459dc358edf8289 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pgs666 <74764545+pgs666@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 07:08:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Input: touchscreen: add refactored Himax HX83121A SPI driver

Synchronize the integrated driver with EGoTouchRev-Linux main at dd96c8e. Split hardware access, sysfs handling, preprocessing, detection, coordinate resolution, and tracking into focused compilation units while retaining the existing Kconfig ABI.
---
